        "cooked": "<p>Rambler shifting heroes around.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-322-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-30-rambler-calls-in-a-debt\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-322-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-30-rambler-calls-in-a-debt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-322-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-30-rambler-calls-in-a-debt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #322: Virtuoso of the Void Vol. 2 #30 “Rambler...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>What's with all the princesses?!  Show Notes: Run Time: 2:14:06 We have not figured out how to keep these episodes under two hours. That (and the fact that June had 5 Tuesdays) has jumped us up a tier in monthly hosting costs. We pay for our...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5c1277b7c2b7d139064a916b7a2ef904cefebbae.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5c1277b7c2b7d139064a916b7a2ef904cefebbae\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c1277b7c2b7d139064a916b7a2ef904cefebbae_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"d8vuD49hECrc9Mak0eHweBIBHeC\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c1277b7c2b7d139064a916b7